## PILLAR 3: INSURE — Verify Before They Start

### Required Insurance (Verify COI Before Work Begins):

**For ALL Subcontractors:**
- [ ] **General Liability** — Minimum $1M per occurrence / $2M aggregate
- [ ] **Workers' Compensation** — State-required minimums (mandatory if sub has employees)
- [ ] **Commercial Auto** — If driving is part of the work (NEMT, courier, delivery, grounds)

**For Specific Service Types:**
- [ ] **Professional Liability / E&O** — Drug testing, fingerprinting, medical courier, lab work, notary
- [ ] **Commercial Auto with Higher Limits** — NEMT ($1M+ per occurrence required by most states)
- [ ] **Pollution Liability** — Grounds maintenance with chemical application
- [ ] **Bonding** — If contract requires performance/payment bonds

### Certificate of Insurance (COI) Requirements

**Every COI MUST show:**
- [ ] DEE DAVIS INC listed as **Additional Insured**
- [ ] Policy effective dates covering the full contract period
- [ ] Coverage limits meeting or exceeding contract requirements
- [ ] 30-day cancellation notice to DDI
- [ ] Insurance company rated A- or better by AM Best

### Insurance Verification Process

```
STEP 1: Request COI from sub (use COI Request template)
STEP 2: Verify coverage types match contract requirements
STEP 3: Verify limits meet minimums
STEP 4: Verify DDI is listed as Additional Insured
STEP 5: Verify policy dates cover contract period
STEP 6: File COI in bid folder + log in Airtable compliance tracking
STEP 7: Set calendar reminder for policy renewal dates
```

**NO COI = NO WORK. Sub does not start until insurance is verified.**

### Insurance by Service Type Quick Reference

| Service Type | Gen Liability | Workers Comp | Auto | Professional/E&O | Bonding |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Drug Testing | $1M/$2M | Required | If mobile | $1M (SAMHSA) | Per contract |
| Fingerprinting | $1M/$2M | Required | If mobile | $1M | Per contract |
| NEMT | $1M/$2M | Required | $1M+ commercial | $1M | State-dependent |
| Grounds/Landscaping | $1M/$2M | Required | Commercial | — | Per contract |
| Medical Courier | $1M/$2M | Required | $1M commercial | $1M (cargo) | Per contract |
| Janitorial | $1M/$2M | Required | If applicable | — | Per contract |
| Construction/Labor | $1M/$2M | Required | If applicable | — | Often required |

