## PILLAR 5: COMMUNICATE — Communication Plan

### Communication Cadence

| Frequency | What | Who |
|---|---|---|
| **Weekly** | Status update from sub to DDI | Sub PM → DDI (Dee) |
| **Bi-weekly** | Performance review call | DDI + Sub PM |
| **Monthly** | Formal performance report | DDI compiles for CO |
| **As needed** | Issues, delays, problems | Sub → DDI immediately |
| **As needed** | CO inquiries, changes | DDI → Sub |

### Communication Rules

1. **Sub NEVER contacts the CO or agency directly** — All government communication goes through DDI
2. **Sub reports issues to DDI IMMEDIATELY** — Don't wait for the weekly update if something goes wrong
3. **DDI provides all contract changes to sub in writing** — No verbal-only changes
4. **All communication is documented** — Emails, not phone calls, for anything that matters
5. **Escalation path:** Sub PM → Dee → CO (never skip DDI)

### Reporting Requirements (Sub Provides to DDI)

- [ ] Weekly status report (work completed, hours, issues)
- [ ] Monthly invoice with supporting documentation
- [ ] Incident reports within 24 hours of any issue
- [ ] Photos/documentation of work performed (where applicable)
- [ ] Staff changes reported within 48 hours

