## PILLAR 6: MANAGE — Ongoing Performance

### Performance Metrics (Track for Every Sub)

| Metric | Target | How to Measure |
|---|---|---|
| On-time delivery | 95%+ | Tasks completed by deadline |
| Quality | Zero rework | CO complaints, inspection results |
| Communication | Same-day response | Response time to DDI requests |
| Compliance | 100% | Insurance current, reports on time, staff cleared |
| Issue resolution | 48 hours | Time from issue reported to resolved |

### Performance Review Process

```
MONTHLY: Review sub performance against metrics
QUARTERLY: Formal performance discussion with sub
ANNUALLY: Full performance evaluation — continue, improve, or replace
ONGOING: Document EVERYTHING — good and bad — for CPARS and future proposals
```

### When to Replace a Subcontractor

**Immediate termination triggers:**
- Contacted the CO or agency directly (violation of agreement)
- Failed to perform critical contract requirements
- Insurance lapsed and not renewed within 5 business days
- Safety violation or injury due to negligence
- Breach of NDA or Non-Compete

**Performance improvement plan first:**
- Consistent late deliveries (3+ in a quarter)
- Quality issues requiring rework
- Communication failures (not responsive)
- Staff turnover without notification

